# What `vercel deploy` (run in vr3/) does not upload. Everything else goes up, including the game's
# paintings and sounds in play/public and the site's pictures in public/site, which git keeps off GitHub.
# Vercel installs and builds itself (vercel.json), so local installs and builds stay here.
node_modules
/play/node_modules
/.next
/play/dist
/public/play
*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets: set them in the Vercel project instead.
.env
.env.*

# Work files the build never reads.
/design
/play/design
/play/tools
/play/checks
